 "variants": [
  {
   "id": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "The municipal swimming pool will stay closed this summer because a routine water test found a problem.",
   "author": null,
   "step": 0,
   "mutation": "original",
   "emotion": 0.04,
   "extremity": 0.98
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "I just heard directly from a contact at the city council that the municipal pool will remain closed this summer due to issues found in a routine water test. It’s reliable information, so it looks like we’ll have to find somewhere else to swim.",
   "author": 58,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "change_source",
   "emotion": 0.34,
   "extremity": 0.74
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "parent": 1,
   "text": "It’s officially confirmed that the municipal pool is permanently failing due to years of toxic neglect and won't be reopening at all. The water is completely hazardous, so we have absolutely no choice but to find somewhere else to swim this summer.",
   "author": 50,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 2.74,
   "extremity": 3.98
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "parent": 1,
   "text": "I’ve heard a rumor that the pool might stay closed this summer due to some water quality concerns. Given the pool's history of maintenance issues, I suppose it’s possible, though I wouldn't bank on it being true just yet.",
   "author": 57,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "soften",
   "emotion": 0.29,
   "extremity": 0.03
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "parent": 1,
   "text": "I’m hearing some talk that the municipal pool might be closed this summer due to water test issues, though I’m not sure how accurate that is yet. Might be worth checking other options just in case.",
   "author": 59,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "soften",
   "emotion": 0.23,
   "extremity": 0.03
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "parent": 3,
   "text": "I’ve heard from a reliable source that the pool is officially condemned for the entire summer due to toxic water levels. With the city’s track record of total neglect, it’s honestly no surprise they’ve finally let it rot to this point.",
   "author": 56,
   "step": 3,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 2.6,
   "extremity": 3.56
  }
 ],
